      "writtenOn": "2025-02-05T23:46:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Since it is used and updated only in that case.\n\nWhen adding SharedBufferMemory previously, I did not find a reason to track a secondary serial for shared buffers, so mLastSharedBufferUsageSerial doesn\u0027t exist. I think mLastUsageSerial is correct to use here.\n\n\u003e But also in the case where the fences were never acquired, maybe we should directly return them instead of doing an immediate unnecessary wait + signal.\n\nI added code to optimize out the flush when EndAccess was called and Dawn did no work, which is what I think you meant here.",
      "parentUuid": "e40b049a_af9d4a71",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 629,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 629,
        "endChar": 36
